WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.115
Web testing without writing code?

00:00:02.115 --> 00:00:03.564
Meet Pocket QA.

00:00:04.583 --> 00:00:08.772
Hit record, use the site as usual, and every step is captured.

00:00:09.350 --> 00:00:12.242
Add steps just by pointing at elements on the page.

00:00:12.817 --> 00:00:15.605
Play back, loop, chain or schedule.

00:00:16.250 --> 00:00:20.206
Every run ends with a clear verdict and a ready-made bug report.

00:00:20.783 --> 00:00:23.767
Run one scenario against a whole CSV file.

00:00:24.383 --> 00:00:28.598
Export to Selenium, Playwright, Robot Framework or Java.

00:00:29.383 --> 00:00:34.479
Plus screenshots, API tests, SQL test design and database rollback.

00:00:35.833 --> 00:00:36.942
Pocket QA.

00:00:36.942 --> 00:00:38.752
Testing, right in your browser.
